# proto-file: vasdk/nlu/entity.proto
# proto-message: vasdk.nlu.EntityPack
#
# Countries, as people name them: values in snake_case, the ISO 3166 codes as attributes
# ($form.country.iso2). In an agent: entity_files: ["<path to VASDK>/entities/country.txtpb"].
